  data: {
    LLM: "Avoid high cards in the Heart suit. Since the Knave of Hearts is the most expensive penalty, holding the Ace or King of Hearts is a major risk.\n\nThe 'Trick Buffer': Since each trick is worth +1 point, you can afford to take a few 'clean' tricks to offset the -5 penalty of the Knave of Spades. Never take a Heart trick if you can avoid it.\n\nVoiding for Safety: Try to exhaust one suit (e.g., Clubs) as quickly as possible. This allows you to discard your high cards in other suits safely throughout the hand.",
    Player: "Avoid high cards in the Heart suit. Since the Knave of Hearts is the most expensive penalty, holding the Ace or King of Hearts is a major risk.\n\nThe 'Trick Buffer': Since each trick is worth +1 point, you can afford to take a few 'clean' tricks to offset the -5 penalty of the Knave of Spades. Never take a Heart trick if you can avoid it.\n\nVoiding for Safety: Try to exhaust one suit (e.g., Clubs) as quickly as possible. This allows you to discard your high cards in other suits safely throughout the hand.",
